cks at each end lift ships up to Gatun Lake, an artificial fresh water lake 26 meters (85 ft) above sea level, created by damming the Chagres River and Lake Alajuela to reduce the amount of excavation work required for the canal. Locks then lower the ships at the other end. The original locks are 33.5 meters (110 ft) wide and allow the passage of Panamax ships. A third, wider lane of locks was constructed between September 2007 and May 2016. The expanded waterway began commercial operation on 26 June 2016. The new locks allow for the transit of larger, Neopanamax ships. An average of…","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama_Canal","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"places":[{"title":"Panama","extract":"Panama, officially the Republic of Panama, is a country located at the southern end of Central America in North America, bordering South America. It is bordered by Costa Rica to the west, Colombia to the southeast, the Caribbean Sea to the north, and the Pacific Ocean to the south. Its capital and largest city is Panama City, whose metropolitan area is home to nearly half of the country's over 4 million inhabitants.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panama","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"PA"}],"arc":{"reports":19,"first_seen":"2026-10-09T18:50:19Z","first_title":"Don't make these mistakes on a Panama Canal cruise","first_url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","first_publisher":"NZ Herald","earlier":[{"id":"e_5991b63f359a","title":"US Sanctions Greece- and Panama-Based Law Firm Over Alleged Iran Shipping Links","date":"2026-10-23T06:28:15Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPb28ySnhpZ3F4XzZDeHBFNHAyR3lFNGJrY3NibU03dVRLdzdnVDdnb2JMVURSUk11dWFrWnZlbklob0FzQ0JWQ3BOSEpXYkItOFBscHhyMmFKZmUzNFBCTmFFaVZhTTdrOXZseDlaMlN2dUNTR29KOE9JWVlHdFZyS29jbUdzVWNVYko1UGRHeG8?oc=5","publisher":"GreekReporter.com","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_f9f7a5fe9b28","title":"Panama Canal reports growth in transits and